We finished the day after 10 matches with GAEA in 7th Place!

This year the ranking is based the average score of your Alliance matches -- not wins and loses. Your Team 4915 ended the day with an average of 48.90 points per match. It was an exciting day filled with fun, cheering, great matches and even dancing!

Remember, tomorrow we only have two regular matches and then the Quarter Finals begin. Keep watching us online live to see if we make it to the next round!

![RobotGaea](../../assets/posts/glacier-peak-schedule-for-saturday/RobotGaea.jpg)

9:40 am  Match 61  - Blue

10:04 am  Match 64 - Red

At the end of the competition, it will be awards time and then we head home to Bainbridge Island!

